  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nWe are trying to use Matrix like our company environment and we have some policy about user naming\r\nOnly administrators should have a permission to change it\r\n\r\nIn homeserver.yaml we have:\r\n`enable_set_displayname: false`\r\n\r\nBut users can still change it via chat command:\r\n`/myroomnick <>`\r\n\r\nSo it will be great to have a opportunity to prohibit the use this and any other / commands\r\nI guess this is good thing for corporate messanger",
